/T (Buy with a US$155 target \(+59%\), based on DCF 70% and comparables 30%. At target the stock trades on 8.7x forward EBITDA, 6.6x trailing adjusted EBITDA and 12.8x trailing earnings, below the peer medians of 9.7x and 17.5x. Rolled forward 12 months at the 10.1% cost of equity the value would be US$171; we hold US$155 as the valuation-date value.)
