/Title (We rate Lululemon Buy with a US$155 target, 59% above the US$97.76 close of 19 October 2026. The shares sit only 9% above our US$90 bear case, so the market already prices a lasting fall in North American sales and margins. A five-year DCF \(US$148, 70% weight\) and trading comparables \(US$173, 30%\) both sit well above the price. The Buy rests on valuation and on North American comparable sales stabilising.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 6830 0 R
/Prev 6949 0 R
