<<
/Title (Comparables give US$173 against US$148 for the DCF because the 9.7x median is applied to forward EBITDA and Lululemon's margin sits well above the peer median, so direct multiples overstate the result. We weight the DCF 70% and comparables 30%. The forward P/E cross-check \(US$128\) is lower than both because a P/E ignores US$1.39bn of net cash; we show it and do not weight it.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7227 0 R
/Prev 7492 0 R
/Next 7384 0 R
>>
