/Title (Deckers and On are the closest economic comparables \(premium brands, high margins, direct selling\); Adidas and Columbia match category and product mix. Nike is a sector benchmark, left out of the median for its scale \(US$45.9bn revenue\) and wholesale mix. Under Armour, VF and Gap were excluded \(turnaround, conglomerate, value positioning\); Athleta, Alo and Vuori have no standalone multiples. We apply the 9.7x median to forward EBITDA of US$1.85bn, not the trailing US$2.43bn, because guidance puts earnings well below trailing, with no premium or discount. The set is split \(Deckers and Columbia near 7.8x, On at 18.3x\); using only the two US peers would cut the target by about US$17.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7438 0 R
/Prev 7539 0 R
/Next 7489 0 R
